# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Packages in Omarchy's own list (install/omarchy-base.packages) that the
# phone image leaves out on purpose. Packages that aren't built for aarch64
# are left out anyway and listed in the image's MANIFEST.
# Registers binfmt handlers to run other architectures' binaries: a laptop's job
qemu-user-static-binfmt
# Hyprbars titlebars for floating workspaces (Omarchy 4.5): a plugin pinned to
# one exact Hyprland version, so it skews against our packages/hyprland build
# and would pull Omarchy's Hyprland over ours (#433); a phone has no floating
# workspaces to put titlebars on
omarchy-hyprland-titlebars
